{"5165390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HOOD", "steam_appid": 5165390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a brokie ended up losing your job because of the local mafia. No other jobs are available and your parents are not alive to help you. Find ways to get your bread to survive the urban jungle. <br>Contend against intensifying law enforcement and deadly mafia syndicates to expand your income sources, pay the bills and feed your homies and yourself.  <br><br><u><strong>Explore and survive the urban jungle of Brokhattan,NY.</strong></u><br><u><strong></strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165390/extras/bc3461702f2a4fc70613bb2f15f5ca5a.poster.avif?t=1788204006\" width=1170 height=552 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165390/extras/bc3461702f2a4fc70613bb2f15f5ca5a.webm?t=1788204006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165390/extras/bc3461702f2a4fc70613bb2f15f5ca5a.mp4?t=1788204006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u><strong>- Collaborate with unique characters in game. </strong></u>  <br>Prepare yourself for mysterious interactions with different homies, connections and even Mafia members.<br>You will have to build your network that will give you the privilege of finding out new ways to get some bread.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165390/extras/482041f76ff0f78c025b3ff882cfd560.poster.avif?t=1788204006\" width=1170 height=552 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165390/extras/482041f76ff0f78c025b3ff882cfd560.webm?t=1788204006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165390/extras/482041f76ff0f78c025b3ff882cfd560.mp4?t=1788204006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>Manage inventory and sell for profit!</strong></u><br>Find, loot, craft, prepare, steal items that can be beneficial not only for your income, but also for blackmailing others for potential job offers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165390/extras/2390c8c32d460ce32f8be7ed2833f653.poster.avif?t=1788204006\" width=1170 height=552 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165390/extras/2390c8c32d460ce32f8be7ed2833f653.webm?t=1788204006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165390/extras/2390c8c32d460ce32f8be7ed2833f653.mp4?t=1788204006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u><strong>Hijack or lock pick cars to help you deliver long distance goods.</strong></u>  <br>Cars can help you not only for traversal but also for storage!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165390/extras/86b0de95345f5f3ad073fc25e433d065.poster.avif?t=1788204006\" width=1170 height=552 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165390/extras/86b0de95345f5f3ad073fc25e433d065.webm?t=1788204006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165390/extras/86b0de95345f5f3ad073fc25e433d065.mp4?t=1788204006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u><strong>Decorate your apartment to your liking! </strong></u> <br>Dont forget to start your day with morning coffee!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl